                    %mi ℝ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} inv(b^{k-1} \mathbb{R})\cong CE(b^k \mathbb{R})
          %p
            For the case at hand, let
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
