                    \\,.
            %p
              This is is exactly equal to the cocycle discussed
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "#InCechDelineCohomology"} above
          %p Notice by the way that this construction also serves as a manifest proof that this collection of data indeed does constitute a Deligne cocycle.
          .proof
            %h6#proof_4 Proof
            %p
              This is a matter of plugging the above pieces into each other. For instance, on double intersections we have that the 3-form
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi CS
